| `make check-exit-codes` `[local]` | Fails when the exit-code table in the limits guide, or the shell helper `scripts/exit_codes.sh`, is stale; the helper absent counts as stale, whatever config/project.json `shell.enabled` says. | `make check-exit-codes` | — | Writes nothing; `make exit-codes` fixes both, and `make exit-codes-sh` the helper alone. | [limits-and-troubleshooting.md](../guides/limits-and-troubleshooting.md) | always |
